{
  "body_human_readable": "### Weather in Kyiv Today: Partly Cloudy with Cold Temperatures\n\nAs of Monday morning in Kyiv, the weather is partly cloudy with temperatures hovering around 2\u00b0C (36\u00b0F). However, due to wind and humidity, the \"feels like\" temperature is colder, at approximately -2\u00b0C (28\u00b0F). Some sources report the current temperature as 1\u00b0C (33\u00b0F) with a \"feels like\" temperature of -3\u00b0C (26\u00b0F).\n\nThere is a low chance of precipitation throughout the day, with some forecasts indicating a 10% chance of snow. The humidity is high, reported between 85% and 96%. Winds are coming from the west and west-southwest at speeds of about 8-9 mph (13-14 km/h), with gusts reaching up to 23 mph (37 km/h).\n\nThe forecast for the remainder of the day indicates that it will remain partly sunny with a high of around 4\u00b0C (39\u00b0F). The evening and night will become partly cloudy with a low of about 1\u00b0C (34\u00b0F). The chance of precipitation remains low into the evening. Sunrise was at 7:26 AM and sunset is expected at 4:03 PM.",
